FFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Define shared size and epic-land model routing primitives[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core_model_routes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core_model_routes: add and bind the provider-agnostic Rust contract for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]size alias selection and explicit/configured epic-land model precedence.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Replace legacy role aliases with the compact config contract[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]alias_config_contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core_model_routes[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]alias_config_contract: reduce built-ins to five direct size aliases, add[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the three model config fields, migrate runtime routing and state, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]diagnose retired names.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Redesign Models around launch settings and flat size aliases[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]models_panel_redesign[dim] · [dim][/dim]after alias_config_contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]models_panel_redesign: build a unified navigable panel for model [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]settings, effort, runner limit, five built-ins, and responsive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]user-owned aliases and buckets.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Complete migration coverage, documentation, and end-to-end [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]verification[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]migration_docs_and_verification[dim] · [dim][/dim]after alias_config_contract, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]models_panel_redesign[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]migration_docs_and_verification: sweep public surfaces for retired [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]aliases, document the new contract, update intentional goldens, and run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exhaustive verification.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-mf","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-mf.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-910adb2e8588d8453618ec95b94bca8a","started_at":"2026-08-15T18:33:52.782815+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-mf","bbugyi200.athena.sase-mf.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-mf.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-mf.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-mf.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-mf.land"]}
